This project's four fixture repositories (repo-baseline/, repo-agent-optimised/,
repo-agent-skill/, repo-agent-recommended/) are each a normalized copy of
fastapi/full-stack-fastapi-template (https://github.com/fastapi/full-stack-fastapi-template),
Copyright (c) 2019 Sebastián Ramírez, also MIT licensed — see the LICENSE file
inside each of those directories. Everything else in this repository (the
orchestration scripts, prompts, documentation layers added to each fixture,
and the results data) is this project's own work.
